# The eMMC is left out of this revision of the mainboard (decided by the user on 2026-11-21).
#
# Why: the Radxa ZERO 3E V1.2 layout this core follows has no eMMC - it boots from its microSD card, and that is the
# arrangement the alpha prototype was tested with.  The eMMC had been put on the place of Radxa's microSD slot,
# opposite the PMIC; four of its balls could not get a via there and its other vias took the room of the PMIC's top
# pin row (about 12 links that never closed).  Storage comes back with an eMCP in the place of the memory chip.
# Boot and flashing: microSD in the hub board's front bay (SDMMC0 through the M.2 socket J41) and USB (J2).
#
# The processor's eMMC balls stay unconnected.  Its VCCIO2 supply stays as it was (21_vccio_flash.net).
SHEET storage
NC U1 A32 B27 B32 B29 B33 A30 B30 A33 A27 A29 1A16 1B16
NC U1 1A15 1A17 1A18 1B17 1C15
